# Git and GitHub

- Commit, push or pull only when asked. Never commit secrets.
- Short imperative commit subject (under about 50 characters).
- GitHub work uses the `gh` CLI; conventions in `docs/agents/issue-tracker.md`, labels in `docs/agents/triage-labels.md`.
- A shipped change adds its entry to `CHANGELOG.md` (a PR hook checks this; `.cursor/changelog-hook.json`).
